3. The applicability of these Directions is as follows
(1) These Directions shall be applicable to the following Non-Banking Financial Companies (hereinafter collectively referred to as ‘NBFCs’ and individually as ‘an NBFC’), subject to layer-wise applicability, unless stated otherwise:
